# Local development secrets — copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in real values.
# Cloudflare Workers reads `.dev.vars` automatically during `wrangler dev`.
# In production, set these as encrypted secrets in the Cloudflare dashboard
# (Workers → Settings → Variables and Secrets) or via `wrangler secret put NAME`.
#
# NEVER commit `.dev.vars` to git (it is already in .gitignore).

# ─── Email (Resend HTTP API) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get an API key at https://resend.com/api-keys
# The sender domain must be verified in Resend (e.g. ecagraray.app or ecagraray.gov.ph).
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Sender "From" address — must use a verified Resend domain.
# Example: "e-Cagraray <noreply@ecagraray.app>"
EMAIL_FROM="e-Cagraray <noreply@ecagraray.app>"

# "Reply-To" shown in the email. Defaults to the official LGU Gmail.
EMAIL_REPLY_TO=ecagraraymanagementsystem@gmail.com
